#. Description of the plugin
#: mlab-eventmanager.php
msgid ""
"Lightweight event management: create, list and manage events in the backend,"
" on the website and quickly on a phone."
msgstr ""
"Schlanke Event-Verwaltung: Events im Backend, auf der Website und schnell "
"per Handy erfassen, auflisten und verwalten."

