msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Hinweise"

#: templates/admin-migration.php:57
msgid "No events from WP Event Manager were found in this website."
msgstr "Auf dieser Website wurden keine Events vom WP Event Manager gefunden."

#. translators: 1: events, 2: venues, 3: organizers found in WP Event Manager.
#: templates/admin-migration.php:64
#, php-format
msgid "Found in WP Event Manager: %1$d events, %2$d venues, %3$d organizers."
msgstr ""
"Im WP Event Manager gefunden: %1$d Events, %2$d Orte, %3$d Veranstalter."

#. translators: 1: events already copied, 2: events still to copy.
#: templates/admin-migration.php:76
#, php-format
msgid "Already copied: %1$d. Still to copy: %2$d."
msgstr "Bereits übernommen: %1$d. Noch zu übernehmen: %2$d."

#: templates/admin-migration.php:83
msgid ""
"Your WP Event Manager data stays untouched. Venues and organizers are copied"
" together with the events that use them. Every run copies up to 50 events; "
"run it again for the rest. Events copied before are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Deine Daten im WP Event Manager bleiben unverändert. Orte und Veranstalter "
"werden zusammen mit den Events übernommen, die sie verwenden. Jeder "
"Durchlauf übernimmt bis zu 50 Events, starte ihn für den Rest erneut. "
"Bereits übernommene Events werden übersprungen."

#. translators: %d: number of skipped events.
#: templates/admin-migration.php:91
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d event was skipped because it has no readable start date. Fix the date in "
"WP Event Manager, then use \"Try skipped events again\"."
msgid_plural ""
"%d events were skipped because they have no readable start date. Fix the "
"dates in WP Event Manager, then use \"Try skipped events again\"."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d Event wurde übersprungen, weil er kein lesbares Startdatum hat. "
"Korrigiere das Datum im WP Event Manager und nutze dann «Übersprungene "
"Events erneut versuchen»."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d Events wurden übersprungen, weil sie kein lesbares Startdatum haben. "
"Korrigiere die Daten im WP Event Manager und nutze dann «Übersprungene "
"Events erneut versuchen»."

